<section class="label-panel" id="label-ingredients" data-label-panel><h3>Ingredients</h3><ol class="ingredients-list"><li><span aria-hidden="true">01</span>Whey Protein Concentrate</li><li><span aria-hidden="true">02</span>Cocoa Powder (Alkalized)</li><li><span aria-hidden="true">03</span>Stabilizer (INS 415)</li><li><span aria-hidden="true">04</span>Sweetener (INS 955)</li><li><span aria-hidden="true">05</span>Edible Salt</li><li><span aria-hidden="true">06</span>Flavour (Chocolate)</li></ol><p class="allergen"><span aria-hidden="true">!</span> Contains milk.</p><ul class="label-notes"><li>Contains added flavours (Natural &amp; Nature Identical Artificial Flavouring Substances).</li><li>No Sugar (Sucrose) added in the product.</li><li>Contains Artificial Sweetener (Sucralose) — For Calorie Conscious.</li></ul></section>
<section class="label-panel" id="label-usage" data-label-panel><h3>How to use</h3><p class="label-serving">Directions as printed on the supplied label.</p><ol class="usage-steps"><li><span aria-hidden="true">01</span><div><h4>Measure</h4><p>Mix 1 scoop (approx. 33 g) with 200 ml cold water or milk in a glass or shaker cup.</p></div></li><li><span aria-hidden="true">02</span><div><h4>Mix</h4><p>Stir or shake until well mixed.</p></div></li><li><span aria-hidden="true">03</span><div><h4>Timing on the label</h4><p>30 minutes before workout and immediately after workout.</p></div></li></ol><h4>Recommended usage on the label</h4><p>Two servings daily. Not to exceed the stated recommended daily usage.</p><details class="label-disclosure" id="usage-notes"><summary>Usage and storage notes<span class="disclosure-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span></summary><div class="disclosure-content"><h4>Storage</h4><p>Store in a cool & dry place. Protect from direct sunlight. Store out of reach of children.</p><ul class="label-notes"><li>Not recommended for children.</li><li>Not for medicinal use.</li><li>Health Supplement is not to be used as a substitute for a varied diet.</li><li>This product is not intended to diagnose, treat, cure or prevent any disease.</li><li>Pregnant or lactating women or people with known medical conditions and or taking medications should consult a medical practitioner before consuming the product.</li></ul></div></details></section>
